<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>수강생 정보 - 이러닝</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif; background: #f3f0ff; margin: 0; }
    header { background: #5f3dc4; color: white; padding: 16px 32px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    header a { color: white; margin-left: 16px; text-decoration: none; }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 30px auto; background: white; padding: 24px; border-radius: 10px; }
    pre { background: #212529; color: #f8f9fa; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 13px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h2>💻 사이버캠퍼스 이러닝 (서비스 B)</h2>
    <div>
      <a href="/courses">내 강의실</a>
      <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="container">
    <h3>👨‍🎓 이러닝 수강생 계정 정보 (SSO 연동)</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>학번(Username):</strong> <%= user.username %></li>
      <li><strong>이름:</strong> <%= user.name %></li>
      <li><strong>이메일:</strong> <%= user.email %></li>
      <li><strong>Keycloak 고유 식별자(sub):</strong> <%= user.id %></li>
    </ul>
    <h4>서비스 B에 발급된 OIDC ID Token</h4>
    <pre><%= user.tokens.id_token %></pre>
  </div>
</body>
</html>